  {
   "turn": 7,
   "response_text": "The final validation accuracy is 0.963143, which is significantly higher than the expected healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. This is about **11.5% higher** than the target. This is a very large discrepancy.\n\nLet me examine the configuration more carefully to see if there's a subset fraction metric configured:",
